{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Dinner Pass 是一款協助用家規劃一週晚餐的應用程式，適合想減少每日決定煮甚麼、同時整理食材與購物清單的家庭或上班族。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-104.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自動規劃一週晚餐</h2>\n<p>用家可選擇每週 3 至 7 頓晚餐，設定成人與小童份量及飲食偏好，並按雞肉、牛肉、豬肉或魚類篩選，亦可選全素食。系統會組合整週菜單，個別菜式可替換或另選一週，也可加入簡易配菜，再依步驟食譜烹調。食材會自動整理成購物清單，可加入額外項目、購物時逐項剔選，煮好後標記完成。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-344-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-345-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-346-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-347-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Dinner Pass</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/dinner-pass/id6801263198?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:01:52.712272+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:52:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:58:29.179978+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:58:34.322943+00:00","content_hash":"692130e9d6980b53dd53e31966c4326da06e5879c706d9d1659a313c11672252","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}